<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Modifying the zoom scale</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="280" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Modifying the zoom scale
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="489">
      <col width="234">
      <col width="237">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Modifying the zoom scale</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">The user changes the scale factor
            of the currently selected network. There are three ways to start changing the scale
            factor by the user, but the end is the same. In this use case the former is explained.
            The other two ways are explained in the use case Modifying the zoom scale from the
            dialog window.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="479">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user selects, in the main menu or in the drop-down menu of the
            standard toolbar, the scale factor between a fixed set.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.1.The user can type an integer value between 10 and 500.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The program checks the value chosen by the user.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the user has decided to type a value and the value is not
            correct, the program will report the fact and the use case will end.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The scale factor of the actual network chosen by the user is
            changed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.The changes in the main menu and toolbar are done for them to show
            the new scale factor.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.The network is showed with the scale factor chosen.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
